            question: Show me Shivdatt's punch details of yesterday
query: "SELECT EMP.EmployeeName,EMP.FatherName,EMP.JobName,EMP.DesignationName,EMP.DepartmentName,BIO.PunchMode,BIO.AttendanceDate,BIO.ModelNo FROM emp.BioAttendance BIO
 INNER JOIN emp.VW_EmployeesList EMP ON BIO.EmployeeId=EMP.Id AND EMP.ActionStatusId=1
  WHERE EMP.EmployeeName LIKE 'Shivdatt%' AND CONVERT(DATE,BIO.AttendanceDate)=CONVERT(DATE, DATEADD(DAY, -1, GETDATE()))
 UNION ALL
